  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "b422f3e4-917b-5046-9c08-4034fb269ff5"],
 ". The input representation requires nonempty diagonal- and lower-block \
lists."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1400439078,ExpressionUUID->"6a4872e1-a537-4c4b-95fb-7772d92bb1bc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each disorder channel adds ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["KroneckerProduct"]], "paclet:ref/KroneckerProduct"},
    "RefLink",
    BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["siteDiagonalRandomMatrix", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["internalMatrix", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "62bd6b1e-2e0a-c946-bd0e-00067defd12a"],
 " to every diagonal block. Site amplitudes are independently sampled from \
the continuous uniform distribution specified by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["RandomReal"]], "paclet:ref/RandomReal"},
    "RefLink",
    BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      FractionBox[
       StyleBox["width", "TI"], "2"]}], ",", 
     FractionBox[
      StyleBox["width", "TI"], "2"]}], "}"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "61881d30-a060-8f45-aad8-56963bb85ad7"],
 ". Lower off-diagonal blocks are preserved."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->810674417,ExpressionUUID->"cff5adbb-77d7-5e4d-9305-8dafbd1fa991"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For several channels, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["widths", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "376458ea-4d94-4e4b-a9ee-1fdf5d4548b1"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["internalMatrices", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e69121e2-f952-ff4f-ac05-c9749a40ff95"],
 " must have the same length. All internal matrices should have the same \
dimension compatible with the site ordering."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1262669055,ExpressionUUID->"2dd07a21-be87-3149-8e6b-dc262d465803"],

